</node>
<node name="09 - Cleanup" unique_id="364" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cjca exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text>Write down everything you upload, create or change, at the moment you do it.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 355" foreground="#1688ff">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text> · </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 1" foreground="#1688ff">Home</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<table char_offset="78" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="137,137,240,209"><row><cell>e.g. the host</cell><cell>e.g. in scope</cell><cell>e.g. the file or change to undo</cell><cell>e.g. yes once removed</cell></row><row><cell>Host</cell><cell>Scope</cell><cell>Change/Cleanup Needed</cell><cell>Cleaned up</cell></row></table>
</node>
<node name="Targets" unique_id="365" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="1" foreground="#1688ff" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text>One node per item. Start with </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 366" foreground="#1688ff">Target 1</rich_text>
<rich_text> and rename it. For each new one, duplicate </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Templates › Target</rich_text>
<rich_text> (</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Tree › Duplicate Node</rich_text>
<rich_text>) and drag the copy under </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Targets</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<node name="Target 1" unique_id="366" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cjca target" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">At a glance
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Status: todo, enumerating, foothold, root or done. Access: none, user or admin.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Creds go in </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 359" foreground="#1688ff">Credentials</rich_text>
<rich_text>, flags in </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 363" foreground="#1688ff">Flags</rich_text>
<rich_text>, changes in </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 364" foreground="#1688ff">Cleanup</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">Access So Far</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">every account you've had here, newest at the bottom</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">Ports &amp; Services</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">Next Up</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">what to try next; tick it off or move it to Dead Ends</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Check what file types the upload form accepts</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">Enumeration</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Notes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Web app on port 80 has an upload form</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Commands</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">Foothold</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Notes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Got a shell as the web server user</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Commands</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">Privilege Escalation</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Notes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. A scheduled task runs a writable script as root</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Commands</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">Loot</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">files, keys, hashes; credentials go in the Credentials note</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. A backup file with database settings</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">Pivots</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">what this host can reach</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. A second network card on an internal subnet</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">Report Evidence</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Screenshot that shows this step worked</rich_text>
<rich_text> </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">paste it right here with Ctrl+V</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">Dead Ends</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">what you tried that didn't work, so you don't try it again</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. An approach you tried for an hour with no result</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#1688ff">Related Modules</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" link="node 14" foreground="#1688ff">M01 - Introduction to Information Security</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
